### Normalized scores (1–100)

- **Tool use: 83/100.** Evidence TB ~75% ; Automation strong; capped by missing Claw-Eval/Tau3 isolation.
- **Reasoning: 82/100.** Evidence GPQA ~80% ; LCR 70%+; capped by incomplete HLE/MRCR.
- **Context window: 96/100.** 1M / 131K out — tiered per methodology (≥1M=95-100, 200K=70, 256K≈72).
- **Multimodal: 85/100.** Text, image, video, PDF in; text out; scored per multimodal rubric (text-only 15, image 60-70, video/PDF 75-90, audio-in 90-100).
- **Coding: 83/100.** Evidence LiveCode ~82% ; SWE ~60%; capped by missing isolated LiveCode/SciCode where noted.
- **Cost efficiency: 45/100.** Paid ~$5/$20 per 1M.
- **Overall Score: 86/100.** Mean of five non-cost dims (83+82+96+85+83)/5=85.8 → 86; best-fit per scoring methodology.

